  "content": "<p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252f4wkDVG6h\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ym2MQ1wH/meccha-crafteleon-title.png\" alt=\"Meccha Crafteleon\"></a>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/NxEFTr4Fv3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-加入我们-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstore.steampowered.com%252fapp%252f4704690%252fMECCHA_CHAMELEON%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/原作游戏-Meccha Chameleon-navy?style=for-the-badge&logo=steam&logoColor=white\" alt=\"原作游戏: Meccha Chameleon\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/meccha-crafteleon/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/前置模组-Meccha Crafteleon-F16436?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"需要模组: Meccha Crafteleon\"></a>\n</p>\n<p>🌍 <strong>公共服务器:</strong> <code>5.196.90.238:25570</code> (MC 1.21.11)</p>\n<h2>Meccha Crafteleon 官方地图包</h2>\n<p>这是 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/meccha-crafteleon/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Meccha Crafteleon</a></strong> 的官方捉迷藏地图包：一个温馨的聚集大厅，以及 5 个专为变色龙模式准备的现成竞技场。</p>\n<p><strong>你是建筑师吗？在 Discord 上申请，让你的作品在我们的地图中展示！</strong></p>\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fRp5Mr4TG\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3yJ86Ym5/meccha-hub.jpg\" alt=\"meccha hub\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fF4nhY01s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/RT7g6BKh/coffee.jpg\" alt=\"coffee\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fJj2cmbfD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PG4rFb7q/cottage.jpg\" alt=\"cottage\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fwhRrGJpL\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ZzV14HcJ/factory.jpg\" alt=\"factory\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fym5LJk3c\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/p6ZCpKmB/mangrove.jpg\" alt=\"mushgrove\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fvyHM1Mt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4v70W0Q/trainstation.jpg\" alt=\"trainstation\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n<h3>包含内容</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>1 个大厅</strong>: 出生点、锁定的游戏规则、夜视效果以及欢迎指南。从这里打开房间即可开始游戏。</li>\n  <li><strong>5 个竞技场</strong>: 大小和主题各异，边界已调整以确保公平的对局。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>推荐的辅助模组</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Simple Voice Chat（简易语音聊天）</strong>: 支持距离语音，听到附近变色龙的窃笑声是游戏乐趣的一半。</li>\n  <li><strong>Sound Physics Remastered（物理音效重制版）</strong>: 3D 音频效果，哨声确实来自特定方向。</li>\n  <li><strong>Sodium + Iris（钠 + 欧若拉）</strong>: 流畅的 FPS 表现（注意：光影会隐藏房间视图滤镜）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>使用方法</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>需要安装 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/meccha-crafteleon/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Meccha Crafteleon</a></strong> 模组 (NeoForge)。建议与 2 到 16 位好友一起体验最佳。</li>\n  <li>单人/LAN: 将文件夹放入你的 <code>saves/</code> 目录。服务器: 将其用作你的世界文件夹。</li>\n  <li>游戏中: 输入 <code>/meccha</code> 打开菜单，在房间面板右侧选择竞技场，然后点击开始。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>躲藏者将自己伪装起来融入环境，猎人射击看起来可疑的目标。祝玩得开心。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NxEFTr4Fv3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-加入我们-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>   <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252faminoquiz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/捐赠-Ko--fi-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Donate\"></a></p>\n<p>没有服务器？使用代码 <code>AMINE</code> 以低至 <strong>1.49 美元/月</strong> 的价格通过我们的合作伙伴 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fmecchacrafteleonsmp\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wabbanode</a> 搭建一个，并享受 <strong>25% 的折扣</strong>！</p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fmecchacrafteleonsmp\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1493170/description_2156c264-8c2e-4898-a3b3-a6a997a30ce7.png\" alt=\"Wabbanode\"></a>\n  <br><em>一键点击。准备好与朋友共度游戏之夜。</em>\n</p>",
